<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f7f4">
    <title>Create your account | Short URLs</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            color: #17231d;
            background: #f5f7f4;
            font-synthesis: none;
            text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-width: 320px;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            padding: 48px 24px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 8%, rgba(196, 228, 185, 0.34), transparent 34%),
                #f5f7f4;
        }

        .page {
            width: min(100%, 1040px);
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 0 0 24px 4px;
            color: #17231d;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 750;
            letter-spacing: -0.035em;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .brand-mark {
            display: grid;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #c5f36c;
            color: #17231d;
        }

        .brand-mark svg {
            width: 17px;
            height: 17px;
        }

        .card {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.92fr 1.08fr;
            min-height: 590px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e8ece6;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(28, 43, 33, 0.09);
        }

        .intro {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 48px 42px 38px;
            background: #18251e;
            color: #f4f7f1;
        }

        .intro::before,
        .intro::after {
            position: absolute;
            width: 290px;
            height: 290px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 243, 108, 0.12);
            border-radius: 50%;
            content: "";
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .intro::before {
            right: -155px;
            bottom: 56px;
        }

        .intro::after {
            right: -112px;
            bottom: 13px;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            margin: 0;
            color: #c5f36c;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 750;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .intro-copy {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            margin: 48px 0 30px;
        }

        .intro h2 {
            max-width: 340px;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px);
            font-weight: 650;
            letter-spacing: -0.055em;
            line-height: 1.08;
        }

        .intro-copy > p {
            max-width: 330px;
            margin: 18px 0 0;
            color: #b6c1b9;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .link-preview {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 340px;
            padding: 17px 18px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .preview-label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: #aab8ad;
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #c5f36c;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(197, 243, 108, 0.5);
        }

        .preview-link {
            color: #d7f6a8;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.015em;
        }

        .preview-destination {
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 6px 0 0;
            color: #95a399;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .intro-footnote {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            margin: 26px 0 0;
            color: #92a096;
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        .form-panel {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 54px 58px;
        }

        .form-content {
            width: min(100%, 360px);
        }

        .form-content h1 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #17231d;
            font-size: 31px;
            font-weight: 680;
            letter-spacing: -0.045em;
        }

        .subtitle {
            margin: 9px 0 30px;
            color: #748078;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .field {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #303d35;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 650;
        }

        input {
            width: 100%;
            height: 46px;
            padding: 0 13px;
            border: 1px solid #dfe5df;
            border-radius: 9px;
            outline: none;
            background: #fff;
            color: #17231d;
            font: inherit;
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: border-color 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease;
        }

        input::placeholder {
            color: #a4ada6;
        }

        input:focus {
            border-color: #83b83b;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(197, 243, 108, 0.28);
        }

        .submit {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 48px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 25px;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #c5f36c;
            color: #1c2a20;
            cursor: pointer;
            font: inherit;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 750;
            transition: background 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
        }

        .submit:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            background: #b8e85e;
        }

        .submit:focus-visible,
        .brand:focus-visible,
        .home-link:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid #83b83b;
            outline-offset: 3px;
        }

        .form-footer {
            margin: 22px 0 0;
            color: #858f88;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .home-link {
            color: #425d32;
            font-weight: 650;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .home-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-underline-offset: 3px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 760px) {
            body {
                padding: 28px 16px;
            }

            .page {
                width: min(100%, 520px);
            }

            .card {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .intro {
                min-height: 315px;
                padding: 30px;
            }

            .intro-copy {
                margin: 30px 0 24px;
            }

            .intro h2 {
                max-width: 430px;
                font-size: 35px;
            }

            .intro-copy > p {
                margin-top: 12px;
            }

            .link-preview,
            .intro-footnote {
                display: none;
            }

            .form-panel {
                padding: 38px 30px 42px;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *,
            *::before,
            *::after {
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="page">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Short URLs home">
            <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                    <path d="M10 13.5 14 9.5m-6.5 6.5-1 1a3.18 3.18 0 0 1-4.5-4.5l4-4a3.18 3.18 0 0 1 4.5 0m3.5 2 1-1a3.18 3.18 0 0 1 4.5 4.5l-4 4a3.18 3.18 0 0 1-4.5 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
            </span>
            Short URLs
        </a>

        <section class="card" aria-label="Create your account">
            <aside class="intro">
                <p class="eyebrow">Make every link count</p>
                <div class="intro-copy">
                    <h2>Short links.<br>Big possibilities.</h2>
                    <p>Bring your links together and make sharing the easy part.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="link-preview" aria-hidden="true">
                    <p class="preview-label"><span class="status-dot"></span>Your links, ready to go</p>
                    <div class="preview-link">short.url/your-next-idea</div>
                    <p class="preview-destination">yourwebsite.com/a-great-place-to-start</p>
                </div>
                <p class="intro-footnote">Simple links. A little more room to grow.</p>
            </aside>

            <div class="form-panel">
                <div class="form-content">
                    <h1>Create your account</h1>
                    <p class="subtitle">Get started with your own space for shorter links.</p>

                    <form action="/user/signup" method="POST">
                        <div class="field">
                            <label for="name">Name</label>
                            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="field">
                            <label for="email">Email address</label>
                            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="field">
                            <label for="password">Password</label>
                            <input id="password" name="password" type="password" placeholder="Create a password" autocomplete="new-password" required>
                        </div>
                        <button class="submit" type="submit">Create account</button>
                    </form>

                    <p class="form-footer">Already have an account? <a class="home-link" href="/login">Log in</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>